e:["$","li",null,{"style":{"marginBottom":"1.5rem"},"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Ulsoor Lake Kayaking"}]," ",["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"#888"},"children":"— Ulsoor, Central Bangalore"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"marginTop":"0.25rem"},"children":"One of the few activities in Bangalore that will genuinely surprise you. Karnataka Windsurfing Association runs kayaking and windsurfing sessions on Ulsoor Lake at very reasonable rates. Book in advance on weekends. The view of the city skyline from the water is something you won't get anywhere else."}]]}]
